### Cek slot tersedia - Dealer Jakarta, tanggal besok
GET http://localhost:5017/api/bookings/available-slots?dealerId=1&date=2025-10-12
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..rXqDJ0iOMA1ErlGj1RM0S_7LnYtCpZFQpsxo26pATOM

### Create booking - Budi servis Xpander
POST http://localhost:5017/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..rXqDJ0iOMA1ErlGj1RM0S_7LnYtCpZFQpsxo26pATOM
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "vehicleId": 5,
  "dealerId": 1,
  "serviceTypeId": 1,
  "bookingDate": "2026-10-12",
  "bookingTime": "09:00:00",
  "complaintNotes": "Servis rutin 10.000 KM, ada bunyi aneh di rem depan",
  "customerNotes": "Mohon dicek juga AC",
  "kmAtService": 10500
}

